+## Validated in LAB
+
+### Fair Pay kernel
+- country policy contract;
+- legal floor / POG floor / country guarantee arbitration;
+- paid/mobilized time separation;
+- tips and expense separation;
+- explicit France estimated-activity duration;
+- production GREEN guard.
+
+### Auditability
+- immutable policy SHA-256;
+- same-version mutation detection;
